#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:5
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Grupe"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:7
msgid ""
"Groups gather members who share something: the board, a team, a section of "
"your association, the people taking part in a project... A member can belong "
"to as many groups as needed, and groups can be nested: a \"Juniors\" group "
"can be placed under a \"Football\" group, for example."
msgstr ""
"Grupe okupljaju članove koji imaju nešto zajedničko: upravu, ekipu, sekciju "
"udruge, sudionike projekta i slično. Član može pripadati proizvoljnom broju "
"grupa, a grupe mogu imati podgrupe: primjerice „Juniori” unutar grupe "
"„Nogomet”."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:9
msgid ""
"Each group can also have **managers**. A manager is a member who looks after "
"the members of the group; what a manager is allowed to do is decided by the "
"association, see :ref:`group managers <pref_rights>`."
msgstr ""
"Svaka grupa može imati **voditelje**. Voditelj je član koji se brine o "
"članovima grupe. Njegove ovlasti određuje udruga; pogledajte :ref:`voditelji "
"grupa <pref_rights>`."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:11
msgid "Groups are managed from **Management**, then **Groups**."
msgstr "Grupama upravljate putem **Upravljanje**, zatim **Grupe**."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:14 ../usermanual/groups.rst:18
msgid "Groups list"
msgstr "Popis grupa"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:16
msgid ""
"The list displays all groups, the subgroups being placed under their parent "
"group."
msgstr "Popis prikazuje sve grupe, s podgrupama ispod nadređenih grupa."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:23
msgid "**New group** creates a group: type its name and click on **Create**,"
msgstr "**Nova grupa** stvara grupu: unesite naziv i kliknite **Stvori**,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:24
msgid ""
"**All groups PDF** exports all groups and their members in a single PDF file,"
msgstr ""
"**PDF svih grupa** izvozi sve grupe i njihove članove u jednu PDF datoteku,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:25
msgid ""
"the icons of the **Actions** column export the group as PDF, edit it, or "
"delete it."
msgstr "ikone stupca **Radnje** izvoze grupu u PDF, uređuju je ili brišu."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:27
msgid ""
"To change the organisation of your groups, drag a group with the arrows icon "
"and drop it under another one: it becomes its subgroup. Moving a group at "
"the top of the list detaches it from its parent. Click on **Save** under the "
"list to keep your changes."
msgstr ""
"Za promjenu ustroja grupa povucite grupu pomoću ikone strelica i ispustite "
"je ispod druge grupe; time postaje njezina podgrupa. Premještanje na vrh "
"popisa odvaja je od nadređene grupe. Kliknite **Spremi** ispod popisa za "
"čuvanje izmjena."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:30 ../usermanual/groups.rst:34
msgid "Editing a group"
msgstr "Uređivanje grupe"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:32
msgid "Click on the edit icon of a group to see and change it."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikonu za uređivanje grupe kako biste je pregledali i izmijenili."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Information**: the name of the group, and its **Parent group** if it is a "
"subgroup,"
msgstr "**Podaci**: naziv grupe i njezina **Nadređena grupa** ako je podgrupa,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Members - Managers**: one line per person attached to the group, with two "
"switches: **Member of group** and **Group manager**. A person can be both."
msgstr ""
"**Članovi – Voditelji grupe**: za svaku osobu povezanu s grupom prikazuje se "
"jedan redak s dvije opcije: **Član grupe** i **Voditelj grupe**. Ista osoba "
"može istodobno biti član i voditelj grupe."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:42
msgid "To change who belongs to the group:"
msgstr "Promijeniti tko pripada grupi:"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:44
msgid ""
"to add someone, search for them in **Add a member**, then click on **Add**: "
"they are added as a member of the group; switch on **Group manager** to make "
"them a manager too,"
msgstr ""
"Za dodavanje osobe pronađite je u polju **Dodaj člana**, a zatim kliknite na "
"**Dodaj**. Osoba će biti dodana kao član grupe. Uključite opciju **Voditelj "
"grupe** kako biste joj dodijelili i ulogu voditelja,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:45
msgid ""
"to change the role of someone already listed, use the switches of their line,"
msgstr ""
"za promjenu uloge osobe koja je već na popisu upotrijebite prekidače u "
"njezinu retku,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:46
msgid ""
"to remove someone from the group, click on the cross at the end of their "
"line. Click on **Cancel** to keep them after all."
msgstr ""
"za uklanjanje osobe iz grupe kliknite na križić na kraju njezina retka. "
"Kliknite na **Odustani** kako biste je ipak zadržali."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:48
msgid ""
"Changed lines are labelled (*added*, *changed*, *will be removed*), and a "
"message reminds you that nothing is stored yet: click on **Save** to keep "
"your changes."
msgstr ""
"Promijenjeni retci označeni su oznakama (*dodano*, *promijenjeno*, *bit će "
"uklonjeno*), a poruka vas podsjeća da promjene još nisu spremljene: kliknite "
"na **Spremi** kako biste spremili promjene."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:50
msgid ""
"Only administrators and staff members can change the members and managers "
"from this page. Group managers see the list, but change the members of their "
"groups from the member cards."
msgstr ""
"Samo administratori i članovi osoblja mogu mijenjati članove i voditelje "
"grupa na ovoj stranici. Voditelji grupa mogu vidjeti popis, ali članstvo u "
"svojim grupama mijenjaju putem kartica članova."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:52
msgid ""
"Members and managers are listed in a single table, instead of being selected "
"in a separate window. Groups of a member card work the same way."
msgstr ""
"Članovi i voditelji grupa prikazani su u jednoj tablici, umjesto da se "
"odabiru u zasebnom prozoru. Upravljanje grupama na kartici člana funkcionira "
"na isti način."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:55
msgid ""
"Groups can also be changed from a member card: the **Groups** part of the "
"member form lists the groups the member belongs to and the groups they "
"manage, with the same switches. Pick a group in **Add to group** and click "
"on **Add** to attach the member to another group."
msgstr ""
"Grupe se mogu mijenjati i putem kartice člana: odjeljak **Grupe** u obrascu "
"člana prikazuje grupe kojima član pripada i grupe kojima upravlja, s istim "
"prekidačima. Odaberite grupu u polju **Dodaj u grupu** i kliknite na "
"**Dodaj** kako biste člana dodali u drugu grupu."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:57
msgid "Groups of a member"
msgstr "Grupe člana"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:63
msgid "Several members at once"
msgstr "Više članova odjednom"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:65
msgid ""
"To add several members to a group, or to remove them from it, in one go:"
msgstr "Za istodobno dodavanje više članova u grupu ili uklanjanje iz nje:"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:67
msgid ""
"go to **Members**, then **List of members**, and select the members with the "
"checkboxes,"
msgstr ""
"otvorite **Članovi**, zatim **Popis članova**, i odaberite članove potvrdnim "
"okvirima,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:68
msgid "choose **Mass change** in the actions displayed under the list,"
msgstr "odaberite **Skupna izmjena** među radnjama ispod popisa,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:69
msgid ""
"in the **Groups:** part, pick a group in **Add to group** or in **Remove "
"from group**,"
msgstr ""
"u odjeljku **Grupe:** odaberite grupu u **Dodaj u grupu** ili **Ukloni iz "
"grupe**,"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:70
msgid "check the summary, and confirm."
msgstr "pregledajte sažetak i potvrdite."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:72
msgid ""
"See :ref:`mass changes <mass_changes>` for the other information that can be "
"changed this way."
msgstr ""
"Za ostale podatke koji se tako mogu mijenjati pogledajte :ref:`skupne "
"izmjene <mass_changes>`."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:75
msgid "Deleting a group"
msgstr "Brisanje grupe"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:77
msgid ""
"Click on the delete icon of the group, and confirm. A group that still has "
"members or subgroups cannot be deleted as is: check **Cascade delete** in "
"the confirmation window to delete the group along with its subgroups. "
"Members are never deleted; they are only removed from the group."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikonu brisanja i potvrdite. Grupa koja još ima članove ili podgrupe "
"ne može se izravno izbrisati: označite **Kaskadno brisanje** u prozoru "
"potvrde kako biste je izbrisali zajedno s podgrupama. Članovi se nikad ne "
"brišu, samo se uklanjaju iz grupe."

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:80
msgid "Groups and searches"
msgstr "Grupe i pretrage"

#: ../usermanual/groups.rst:82
msgid ""
"The members list can be filtered on a group, and the :ref:`advanced search "
"<advsearch>` can find members belonging to several groups at once."
msgstr ""
"Popis članova može se filtrirati prema grupi, a :ref:`napredno pretraživanje "
"<advsearch>` može pronaći članove koji istodobno pripadaju više grupa."

